			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 19, DX 10, IQ 6, HT 11, HP 19, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 11, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 6, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
